            { "set.pqos.n", new[]{ "系统在一段时间未收到键鼠输入后会判定用户离开，将前台程序降低一档服务质量。手柄游戏、过场动画和挂机场景本就没有键鼠活动，因此普遍受影响，表现为静置一段时间后帧数下降。本项在对局期间持续告知系统用户在场，退出游戏后自动解除。", "After a period without keyboard or mouse input, the system decides the user is away and drops the foreground app one quality-of-service tier. Controller games, cutscenes, and idle scenarios have no keyboard/mouse activity to begin with, so they are widely affected — frame rate drops after sitting still for a while. This item continuously tells the system the user is present during matches and releases automatically after you exit the game." } },
            { "set.awake", new[]{ "对局期间阻止息屏与睡眠", "Block display-off and sleep during matches" } },
            { "set.awake.n", new[]{ "成因同上：系统按键鼠活动判断用户是否在场，手柄游戏和长过场动画容易被判定为挂机，导致息屏甚至进入睡眠。本项在对局期间持续告知系统保持唤醒，退出游戏后自动解除，不修改电源计划中的超时设置。", "Same cause as above: the system judges presence by keyboard/mouse activity, so controller games and long cutscenes are easily treated as idle, turning off the display or even entering sleep. This item continuously tells the system to stay awake during matches, releases automatically after you exit the game, and does not modify the power plan's timeout settings." } },
