            { "v15.library.force.confirm", new[]{ "对 {0} 开启强制接管？\r\n\r\n开启后，只要该 EXE 的进程存在即判定为对局中，不再依据前台窗口和渲染画面，也不受内置非游戏名单限制。适用于模拟器、云游戏、老游戏以及没有独占全屏的程序。\r\n\r\n代价是对局不会自动结束。若指向常驻后台的程序，Pavise 将持续处于游戏模式，后台压制不解除、电源计划保持锁定，整机性能反而下降。\r\n\r\n请仅对需要手动启停的程序使用。", "Enable forced takeover for {0}?\r\n\r\nOnce enabled, a match is considered in progress whenever this EXE's process exists, no longer based on foreground window and rendered frames, and no longer limited by the built-in non-game list. Suited for emulators, cloud gaming, older games, and programs without exclusive fullscreen.\r\n\r\nThe cost: the match never ends automatically. If it points at a program that stays resident in the background, Pavise remains in game mode permanently — background suppression never lifts, the power plan stays locked, and overall performance gets worse.\r\n\r\nUse only for programs you start and stop manually." } },
