            { "plan.pick.local", new[]{ "本机", "Local" } },
            { "plan.pick.desc", new[]{ "退出游戏后自动切回。默认使用 Pavise 托管方案，首次对局自动创建，各项参数按本机处理器写入，名称带 PG 标签和本机签名，一键还原会连它删掉。选择本机已有计划时，Pavise 只负责切换，不修改该计划的任何参数。笔记本发热偏高时可改选平衡。", "Switches back automatically after you exit the game. Defaults to the Pavise-managed plan, created automatically at the first match with parameters written for this machine's processor; its name carries the PG tag and a machine signature, and one-click restore deletes it too. When you pick an existing local plan, Pavise only switches to it and never modifies any of its parameters. On laptops running hot, consider Balanced instead." } },
