            { "white.required.badge", new[]{ "内置保护", "Built-in protection" } },
            { "white.reset.confirm", new[]{ "恢复默认预设将删除全部自定义白名单规则，且无法撤销。", "Restoring the default preset will delete all custom whitelist rules and cannot be undone." } },
            { "btn.reset", new[]{ "恢复默认预设", "Restore default preset" } },

            { "btn.openlog", new[]{ "打开日志文件", "Open log file" } },

            { "set.gpu.n", new[]{ "双显卡笔记本上，系统有时会将游戏分配给核显，导致帧数大幅下降，而系统设置中的逐程序偏好列表较为隐蔽，多数用户不会调整。本项将游戏库中的每个游戏写为高性能 GPU，仅写入偏好，不修改驱动也不禁用核显。下次启动游戏时生效，关闭后即还原。", "On dual-GPU laptops the system sometimes assigns the game to the integrated GPU, tanking the frame rate, and the per-app preference list in system settings is obscure enough that most users never touch it. This sets every game in the game library to the high-performance GPU — it only writes the preference, without modifying the driver or disabling the integrated GPU. Takes effect the next time the game starts; turning it off restores the original state." } },
            { "set.dvr", new[]{ "关闭 Game DVR 与 Xbox 后台录制", "Disable Game DVR and Xbox background recording" } },
            { "set.dvr.sub", new[]{ "Game DVR 开启时，系统会持续在后台滚动缓存最近数分钟的画面，长期占用显卡编码单元和内存，而多数用户并不使用该回放功能。关闭后 Xbox 的即时回放和录制热键将失效，依赖该功能录制集锦的用户请勿开启。仅自定义模式可自行选择，专注强制开启，智能强制关闭。", "With Game DVR on, the system keeps a rolling buffer of the last few minutes of gameplay in the background, permanently occupying the GPU encoder and memory, while most users never use that replay feature. After disabling, Xbox instant replay and the recording hotkeys stop working — users who rely on them for highlight clips should leave this off. Only Custom mode allows a free choice; Focus forces it on, Smart forces it off." } },
            { "gm.squeezebg", new[]{ "重压后台绑核收缩", "Squeeze heavily suppressed background onto fewer cores" } },
            { "gm.squeezebg.sub", new[]{ "将已被重压的后台由铺满全部核心收缩至少数几个物理核，针对的是其并发访存对内存带宽的挤占，该问题优先级和效率模式均无法覆盖。落点由算法跟随当前游戏核心划分实时计算，同一核心不会既分配给游戏又作为落点。代价是这些后台程序响应明显变慢，压缩解压、编译和转码类任务耗时会成倍增加；切换至该程序的瞬间立即解除。默认开启。", "Shrinks already heavily suppressed background processes from spanning all cores down to a handful of physical cores, targeting the memory-bandwidth contention of their concurrent memory access — a problem neither priority nor efficiency mode can address. The landing cores are computed in real time by the algorithm following the current game core partition; no core is ever both assigned to the game and used as a landing spot. The cost is that these background programs respond noticeably slower — compression, compilation, and transcoding tasks take several times longer; switching to such a program releases it instantly. On by default." } },
            { "gm.squeezebg.none", new[]{ "本机仅有 {0} 个物理核，少于 {1} 个，收缩后剩余核心不足以支撑后台运行，本项在本机始终不生效。", "This machine has only {0} physical cores, fewer than {1}; after squeezing, the remaining cores could not sustain background work, so this item never takes effect on this machine." } },
            { "gm.squeezebg.smallcpu", new[]{ "本机物理核心数不超过 6，实测绑核收缩会反伤前台性能，因此本项强制关闭。", "This machine has no more than 6 physical cores. Measured results show that squeezing background work onto fewer cores hurts foreground performance, so this item is forced off." } },
            { "gm.squeezebg.multigroup", new[]{ "本机为多处理器组，亲和掩码无法跨组，本项不生效。", "This machine has multiple processor groups; affinity masks cannot span groups, so this item has no effect." } },
            { "gm.squeezebg.narrow", new[]{ "当前划分下后台仅剩 {0} 个物理核，已窄于收缩目标，无可收缩余地，本项暂不执行。适当收回游戏核心后将重新生效。", "Under the current partition the background has only {0} physical cores left, already narrower than the squeeze target, so there is no room to squeeze and this item is on hold. It re-activates once some game cores are given back." } },
            { "gm.gpudemote", new[]{ "后台 GPU 优先级降级", "Background GPU priority demotion" } },
            { "gm.gpudemote.sub", new[]{ "后台程序提交显卡任务时会插入游戏的队列，游戏须等待其完成后才被调度，表现为帧时间突然拉长。本项将其显卡优先级降至游戏之下。副作用是直播推流、录屏和视频硬解会明显掉帧，使用这类功能请先将 OBS 等程序加入白名单。", "When background programs submit GPU work it cuts into the game's queue, and the game must wait for it to finish before being scheduled — showing up as sudden frame-time spikes. This drops their GPU priority below the game's. The side effect is that live streaming, screen recording, and hardware video decoding will visibly drop frames; if you use those, add OBS and similar programs to the whitelist first." } },
            { "gm.boost", new[]{ "游戏进程提优", "Game process boost" } },
            { "gm.lane", new[]{ "渲染线程单独提优", "Separate boost for the render thread" } },
            { "gm.lane.sub", new[]{ "游戏通常有上百个线程，实际决定帧数的往往只有一个。开局识别出该线程后单独提升一档，在游戏内部线程互相争抢 CPU 时优先保障画面输出，6 核 12 线程一类容易被占满的机器收益最大。无法识别时退回为整个进程统一提优，不会误提。", "A game usually has hundreds of threads, but often just one actually determines the frame rate. Once identified at match start, that thread gets one extra tier of boost so frame output stays prioritized when the game's own threads fight over the CPU — machines that saturate easily, like 6-core 12-thread parts, benefit most. If it cannot be identified, this falls back to boosting the whole process uniformly; nothing is boosted by mistake." } },
            { "ac.roster", new[]{ "反作弊相容名单", "Anti-cheat compatibility list" } },
            { "ac.roster.sub", new[]{ "内核反作弊拒绝写入的游戏会记在这里，Pavise 对它们不再反复重试优先级和 IO，显卡调度与帧线程照常尝试。换版本后名单自动失效重新试一遍，也可以在这里手动清空。", "Games whose process the kernel anti-cheat refuses writes to are listed here; Pavise stops retrying priority and I/O for them while still attempting GPU scheduling and the frame thread. The list expires by itself on a new version so everything is retried, and you can clear it here." } },
            { "ac.roster.empty", new[]{ "名单为空", "The list is empty" } },
            { "ac.roster.confirm", new[]{ "清空后下一局会重新尝试这些游戏的本体提优。反作弊仍然拒绝的话会再次记回名单。要清空吗", "After clearing, the next match will try boosting these games again. If the anti-cheat still refuses, they will be recorded once more. Clear the list?" } },
            { "btn.roster.clear", new[]{ "清空", "Clear" } },
            { "gm.idledis", new[]{ "对局禁用处理器空闲", "Disable processor idle during a match" } },
            { "gm.mmcss", new[]{ "MMCSS 多媒体调度", "MMCSS multimedia scheduling" } },
            { "gm.mmcss.sub", new[]{ "把系统留给非多媒体工作的份额从 20% 调到 10%，并把 Games 任务的调度类别和文件 IO 提到高档。只有主动登记了多媒体任务的游戏直接吃这套参数，其余游戏受益的是音频线程更少被后台打断。游戏模式开启期间常驻，关闭开关或退出 Pavise 即还原，需要管理员权限。", "Cuts the share the system reserves for non-multimedia work from 20% to 10%, and raises the Games task's scheduling category and file I/O to high. Only games that register a multimedia task use these parameters directly; for the rest the benefit is audio threads being interrupted less by background work. Stays applied while game mode is on and is restored when the switch is turned off or Pavise exits. Requires administrator rights." } },
            { "gm.ifeo", new[]{ "后备提优 由系统在启动时下发", "Fallback boost, applied by the system at launch" } },
            { "gm.ifeo.sub", new[]{ "内核级反作弊会阻止外部程序修改游戏优先级，Pavise 无法取得句柄权限。本项改用另一条路径，由 Windows 在游戏进程创建时即设定优先级，不受反作弊阻拦。仅写入优先级一项，不涉及调试器劫持相关的键。下次启动游戏时生效，关闭本开关将立即清除已写入的项。", "Kernel-level anti-cheat blocks external programs from changing the game's priority, so Pavise cannot obtain handle access. This takes another path: Windows sets the priority at the moment the game process is created, out of the anti-cheat's reach. Only the priority entry is written; nothing related to debugger hijacking is touched. Takes effect the next time the game starts; turning this switch off immediately removes the written entry." } },
            { "gm.aggressive", new[]{ "后台压制范围与力度加码", "Wider and stronger background suppression" } },
            { "gm.aggressive.sub", new[]{ "开启后将后台压制至最高档，作用范围同步放宽，带窗口的浏览器、语音和 IDE 一并压制，切出游戏也不放行。游戏、反作弊、加速器、白名单和系统核心始终不在范围内。输入法和外设驱动请自行加入白名单。仅自定义模式可自行选择，专注强制开启，智能强制关闭。默认关闭。", "When on, background suppression runs at the highest tier with a correspondingly wider scope: windowed browsers, voice apps, and IDEs are suppressed too, and nothing is let through even when you alt-tab out. Games, anti-cheat, game accelerators, the whitelist, and system core components are always out of scope. Add your input method and peripheral drivers to the whitelist yourself. Only Custom mode allows a free choice; Focus forces it on, Smart forces it off. Off by default." } },
            { "gm.pausedl", new[]{ "暂停后台下载与传递优化", "Pause background downloads and Delivery Optimization" } },
            { "gm.pausedl.sub", new[]{ "Windows 更新和传递优化会在后台持续收发数据，传递优化还会将本机作为局域网内其他计算机的更新源，上行被占满会直接表现为延迟升高。本项在对局中停止这两项，退出后恢复，不修改系统中的更新设置。仅自定义模式可自行选择，专注强制开启，智能强制关闭。", "Windows Update and Delivery Optimization keep sending and receiving data in the background, and Delivery Optimization also serves this machine as an update source for other computers on the LAN — a saturated uplink shows up directly as higher latency. This stops both during a match and resumes them on exit, without modifying system update settings. Only Custom mode allows a free choice; Focus forces it on, Smart forces it off." } },
            { "gm.wlanguard", new[]{ "对局期间抑制无线后台扫描", "Suppress background wireless scanning during matches" } },
            { "gm.wlanguard.nowifi", new[]{ "本机没有无线网卡 此项无事可做 该功能只对 Wi-Fi 联机的机器有意义（抑制周期性信道扫描造成的延迟尖峰）", "This machine has no wireless adapter, so there is nothing for this switch to do. It only matters on machines gaming over Wi-Fi (suppresses latency spikes from periodic channel scans)." } },
            { "gm.wlanguard.sub", new[]{ "系统每隔数十秒会扫描全部信道以查找可用网络，扫描期间网卡必须离开当前连接的频道，数据包只能排队等待，无线环境下周期性的延迟突刺多源于此。副作用是对局中不会自动发现新的 Wi-Fi。有线连接和无无线网卡的机器不受影响。退出后恢复。", "Every few dozen seconds the system scans all channels for available networks. During the scan the wireless adapter must leave the channel it is connected to, so packets can only queue and wait — periodic latency spikes on Wi-Fi often come from this. The side effect is that new Wi-Fi networks will not be discovered automatically during a match. Wired connections and machines without a wireless adapter are unaffected. Restored on exit." } },
            { "set.autostart", new[]{ "开机自启", "Launch at startup" } },
            { "set.autostart.n", new[]{ "通过管理员计划任务实现，开机时不会弹出 UAC 确认框。", "Implemented via an administrator scheduled task, so no UAC prompt appears at boot." } },
            { "set.autohide", new[]{ "检测到游戏后自动收起窗口", "Auto-hide window when a game is detected" } },
            { "set.autohide.n", new[]{ "检测到游戏 10 秒后窗口自动收回托盘，每局仅执行一次，之后手动打开不会再被收起。", "The window retracts to the tray 10 seconds after a game is detected. This runs once per match; opening it manually afterwards will not hide it again." } },
            { "set.hint", new[]{ "此页仅包含应用自身的偏好与维护工具。显卡相关项在显卡页，修改系统的开关在系统环境页。", "This page only contains the app's own preferences and maintenance tools. GPU-related items are on the Graphics page; switches that modify the system are on the System Environment page." } },
            { "sec.pergame", new[]{ "逐游戏，对局开始时下发，结束后还原", "Per-game, applied at match start and restored afterwards" } },
            { "sec.amd", new[]{ "AMD 显卡，对局开始时全局生效，结束后还原", "AMD GPUs, applied globally at match start and restored afterwards" } },
            { "set.msifix", new[]{ "显卡 MSI 中断修复", "GPU MSI interrupt fix" } },
            { "set.msifix.n", new[]{ "检测到显卡的消息信号中断被显式关闭（MSISupported=0），多为旧优化工具残留。中断退回传统线模式会抬高 DPC 延迟和帧时间抖动。本项把该值写回 1，重启后生效；关闭开关即还原原值。现代驱动默认就是 MSI，本项只在被人为关闭时可用。", "The GPU's message-signaled interrupts were detected as explicitly disabled (MSISupported=0), usually left behind by old optimization tools. Falling back to legacy line-based interrupts raises DPC latency and frame-time jitter. This option writes the value back to 1, effective after a reboot; turning the switch off restores the original value. Modern drivers use MSI by default — this option is only available when it has been manually disabled." } },
            { "msifix.clean", new[]{ "本机显卡的消息信号中断未被干预，无需修复，本项停用。", "This machine's GPU message-signaled interrupts have not been tampered with. No fix needed; this option is disabled." } },
            { "gfx.tab.common", new[]{ "通用", "General" } },
            { "gfx.sub.common", new[]{ "不分厂商，逐游戏下发，结束后还原", "Vendor-agnostic, applied per game and restored afterwards" } },
            { "set.amd.none", new[]{ "未检测到 AMD 显卡驱动，本项停用", "No AMD GPU driver detected; this option is disabled" } },
            { "set.rsr", new[]{ "RSR 驱动级升格", "RSR driver-level upscaling" } },
            { "set.rsr.n", new[]{ "Radeon Super Resolution：游戏内选低一档分辨率渲染，驱动放大回原生分辨率，几乎全游戏通用。这是拿画质换帧率的交易，画面会整体变软，1080p 屏幕损失明显。对局开始时开启，退出还原。", "Radeon Super Resolution: pick a resolution one step below native in-game and the driver upscales it back to native — works in almost every game. This trades image quality for frame rate: the picture softens overall, and the loss is noticeable on 1080p displays. Enabled at match start, restored on exit." } },
            { "rsr.warn", new[]{ "开启前请确认：这是画质换帧率的交易。\n\n需要你在游戏内把分辨率调低一档（如原生的 77%）才会生效；画面会整体变软、细节可能闪烁，1080p 屏幕上尤其明显。竞技求帧数可以开，重画质的游戏不建议。\n\n确定开启？", "Before enabling, be aware: this trades image quality for frame rate.\n\nIt only takes effect if you set the in-game resolution one step below native (e.g. 77% of native); the picture softens overall and details may shimmer, especially on 1080p displays. Fine for competitive play chasing frames; not recommended for visually rich games.\n\nEnable it?" } },
            { "set.gpupower", new[]{ "对局功耗墙拉满", "Max out the power limit during matches" } },
            { "set.gpupower.n", new[]{ "对局中把显卡功耗上限拉到厂商允许的最大值，撞功耗墙的卡能多保住一些频率，退出对局自动还原。代价是发热和风扇噪音全程更高，散热能力不足的笔记本或小机箱会更早触及温度墙，触发温度降频后结果可能低于不开启。笔记本 NVIDIA 显卡的功耗多为固定值，本项可能无效。", "Raises the GPU power limit to the vendor's maximum during matches; cards hitting the power wall can hold on to more clock speed. Restored automatically when the match ends. The cost is higher heat and fan noise throughout; laptops or small-form-factor builds with weak cooling will hit the thermal limit sooner, and once thermal throttling kicks in the result may end up worse than leaving it off. On laptop NVIDIA GPUs the power limit is often fixed, so this option may have no effect." } },
            { "set.gpupower.nosup", new[]{ "本机显卡不支持调整功耗上限，或当前已在上限运行", "This machine's GPU does not support adjusting the power limit, or it is already running at the maximum" } },
            { "set.amd.nosup", new[]{ "本机 GPU 或驱动版本不支持该功能，本项停用", "This machine's GPU or driver version does not support this feature; this option is disabled" } },
            { "set.amdalag", new[]{ "AMD Anti-Lag 低延迟", "AMD Anti-Lag low latency" } },
            { "set.amdalag.n", new[]{ "驱动调度层压缩 CPU 提前量，显卡满载时明显降低从操作到画面的延迟，AMD 官方数据最多降三成，显卡未跑满时收益趋零。对 DX9、DX11 和 DX12 游戏生效，纯驱动调度，不注入游戏代码，与反作弊无冲突；游戏内建 Anti-Lag 2 时以游戏内为准。与 Chill 互斥，开启时驱动会暂关 Chill，本软件已连同快照，退出对局一并还原；与「AMD 帧率上限」同开时限帧优先，本项让位。", "The driver's scheduling layer compresses the CPU's lead time, noticeably reducing input-to-display latency when the GPU is fully loaded — up to 30% by AMD's official numbers; the benefit approaches zero when the GPU is not maxed out. Works with DX9, DX11 and DX12 games. Pure driver scheduling, no code injected into the game, so no conflict with anti-cheat; when the game has built-in Anti-Lag 2, the in-game setting takes precedence. Mutually exclusive with Chill: the driver temporarily turns Chill off when this is on — Pavise snapshots it too and restores both when the match ends. When enabled together with \"AMD frame rate cap\", the frame cap takes priority and this option yields." } },
            { "set.amdafmf", new[]{ "AMD 流体运动帧 驱动插帧", "AMD Fluid Motion Frames driver frame generation" } },
            { "set.amdafmf.n", new[]{ "驱动级插帧 AFMF，在两张真实画面之间推算一帧，帧率视觉上接近翻倍，不需要游戏支持。代价是输入延迟明显增加，实测竞技场景可能翻倍，对战游戏不要开启，适合单机大作追求观感。基础帧率低于 60 时瑕疵明显，建议配合可变刷新率屏幕。对 DX11、DX12、Vulkan 和 OpenGL 游戏生效。退出对局恢复原值。", "Driver-level frame generation (AFMF) interpolates one frame between two real frames, visually near-doubling the frame rate with no game support required. The cost is a clear increase in input latency — measured to potentially double in competitive scenarios. Do not enable it for PvP games; it suits big single-player titles that prioritize visual smoothness. Artifacts are obvious when the base frame rate is below 60; pairing with a variable-refresh-rate display is recommended. Works with DX11, DX12, Vulkan and OpenGL games. Restored to the original value when the match ends." } },
            { "sec.app", new[]{ "应用自身", "The app itself" } },
            { "dlg.ok", new[]{ "知道了", "Got it" } },
            { "dlg.confirm", new[]{ "确定", "OK" } },
            { "dlg.cancel", new[]{ "取消", "Cancel" } },
            { "dlg.tag.info", new[]{ "提示", "Info" } },
            { "dlg.tag.warn", new[]{ "注意", "Notice" } },
            { "dlg.tag.danger", new[]{ "警告", "Warning" } },
            { "dlg.tag.done", new[]{ "完成", "Done" } },
            { "sec.maint", new[]{ "维护", "Maintenance" } },
            { "nav.graphics", new[]{ "显卡", "Graphics" } },
            { "nav.env", new[]{ "系统环境", "System Environment" } },
            { "nav.audit", new[]{ "系统体检", "System Checkup" } },
            { "nav.stutter", new[]{ "卡顿溯源", "Stutter Trace" } },
            { "gm.framediag.moved", new[]{ "这两个开关连同它们的判决 证据和逐窗明细 都挪到了卡顿溯源页 开关和它产出的数据放在一起才看得懂", "These switches, together with their verdict, evidence, and per-window detail, now live on the Stutter Trace page. A switch is only meaningful next to the data it produces" } },
            { "gm.goto", new[]{ "去那一页", "Open page" } },
            { "remedy.none", new[]{ "还没有判决", "No verdict yet" } },
            { "remedy.noslow", new[]{ "本局没有卡顿帧 不需要处置", "No stuttering frames this session; nothing to fix" } },
            { "remedy.unproven.title", new[]{ "有卡顿 但成因不在能证明的那几维里", "There is stuttering, but the cause is outside what can be proven" } },
            { "remedy.unproven.why", new[]{ "证不出成因时不给动作 猜一个目标去改比不改更糟", "No action is offered without proof; guessing a target is worse than doing nothing" } },
            { "remedy.cpu.title", new[]{ "后台进程抢走了 CPU 已经在自动压制", "A background process is taking CPU; automatic suppression is already active" } },
            { "remedy.cpu.why", new[]{ "抢占解释了这批慢帧超额的 {0}", "Preemption explains {0} of the excess frame time" } },
            { "remedy.cpu.path", new[]{ "{0}%（关键路径口径）", "{0}% (critical-path measure)" } },
            { "remedy.cpu.window", new[]{ "{0}%（窗级口径 未通过关键路径证明）", "{0}% (window-level measure, not proven on the critical path)" } },
            { "remedy.disk.title", new[]{ "硬缺页把渲染线程挡住了", "Hard page faults are blocking the render thread" } },
            { "remedy.disk.why", new[]{ "这一维目前只有结论没有处置手段 内存不足或页面文件设置要人来定", "This dimension has a verdict but no automatic fix; memory pressure and page file settings are yours to decide" } },
            { "remedy.disk.why2", new[]{ "硬缺页解释了这批慢帧超额的 {1}%  当前可用物理内存 {0}%", "Hard page faults explain {1}% of the excess frame time; {0}% of physical memory is currently free" } },
            { "remedy.disk.noproof", new[]{ "这一维没有给按钮 清理待机内存能不能减少硬缺页 我们没有证据 它丢掉的是本来就在内存里的缓存页 反而可能制造新的缺页", "No button is offered here. We have no evidence that purging the standby list reduces hard page faults; it discards cached pages that were already resident and may cause new faults instead" } },
            { "remedy.noaction", new[]{ "没有可执行的处置", "No fix can be applied" } },
            { "remedy.irq.why", new[]{ "长中断占慢帧 {0}%  超额解释 {1}%  单次最长 {2}us", "Long interrupts cover {0}% of slow frames, explain {1}% of the excess, longest single {2}us" } },
            { "remedy.irq.short.title", new[]{ "长中断来自 {0} 但单次都不够长", "Long interrupts come from {0}, but no single one is long enough" } },
            { "remedy.irq.short.blocked", new[]{ "单次最长只有 {0}us 挪核换不回一帧 门槛是 {1}us", "The longest single interrupt is only {0}us; moving cores will not win back a frame. The threshold is {1}us" } },
            { "remedy.irq.nodev.title", new[]{ "长中断来自 {0} 但定位不到具体设备", "Long interrupts come from {0}, but no specific device can be located" } },
            { "remedy.irq.nodev.blocked", new[]{ "{0}。真正的设备在它下层 我们分不出来 就不猜", "{0}. The real device sits below it and we cannot tell which, so we do not guess" } },
            { "remedy.irq.taken.title", new[]{ "长中断来自 {0}", "Long interrupts come from {0}" } },
            { "remedy.irq.taken.blocked", new[]{ "这块设备的中断亲和已经由环境页那个开关在管 这里不重复下手", "This device's interrupt affinity is already managed by the switch on the System Environment page; it is not touched twice" } },
            { "remedy.irq.title", new[]{ "把 {0} 的中断挪离游戏所在的核", "Move {0} interrupts away from the cores the game runs on" } },
            { "remedy.needadmin", new[]{ "帧修复 需要管理员权限", "Frame remedy needs administrator rights" } },
            { "remedy.logprefix", new[]{ "帧修复 中断亲和 ", "Frame remedy IRQ affinity " } },
            { "remedy.residue", new[]{ "帧修复中断亲和", "frame remedy IRQ affinity" } },
            { "resolver.nodriver", new[]{ "没有驱动名", "No driver name" } },
            { "resolver.kernel", new[]{ "内核本体或框架层 没有单独的设备可调", "Kernel core or framework layer; there is no individual device to tune" } },
            { "resolver.nosvc", new[]{ "驱动名解不出服务名", "The driver name yields no service name" } },
            { "resolver.noenum", new[]{ "这个驱动没有绑定任何设备 不是即插即用设备驱动", "This driver is bound to no device; it is not a plug and play device driver" } },
            { "resolver.emptylist", new[]{ "驱动的设备清单是空的", "The driver's device list is empty" } },
            { "resolver.toomany", new[]{ "这个驱动挂着 {0} 个设备 太多 不整批处置", "This driver carries {0} devices, too many to treat as one batch" } },
            { "resolver.readfail", new[]{ "读设备清单失败 {0}", "Failed to read the device list: {0}" } },
