            { "gm.frameact", new[]{ "帧卡顿自动处置", "Act on stutter attribution" } },
            { "gm.frameact.sub", new[]{ "溯源确认某个后台进程正在抢占游戏帧线程时，把它的压制档位提高一级，然后用下一个观察窗验证：抢占确实降下来才保留，没降下来立刻恢复并本局不再碰它。只对压制功能本来就会处理的后台进程生效，绝不新增目标，游戏本体、反作弊、系统组件、白名单一律不受影响。需要先开启帧卡顿溯源。", "When attribution confirms a background process is preempting the game frame thread, its suppression level is raised one step, then verified against the next observation window: it stays only if preemption actually drops, otherwise it is restored immediately and left alone for the rest of the session. It only applies to background processes suppression already handles, never adds new targets, and never affects the game, anti-cheat, system components, or the whitelist. Requires stutter attribution to be on." } },
            { "gm.frameact.needdiag", new[]{ "需要先开启帧卡顿溯源 没有归因结论就无从处置。", "Requires stutter attribution first: without an attribution verdict there is nothing to act on." } },
            { "t.frameoffender.1", new[]{ "，本局不再处置它", "; it will be left alone for the rest of the session" } },
            { "t.frameoffender.2", new[]{ "已提档 {0} 次，其中 {1} 次实测抢占确实降下来了", "escalated {0} times, {1} of which measurably reduced preemption" } },
            { "t.frameoffender.3", new[]{ "已提档 {0} 次但抢占没降下来，已恢复", "escalated {0} times without reducing preemption; restored" } },
            { "t.frameoffender.4", new[]{ "已提档 {0} 次，还在观察", "escalated {0} times, still under observation" } },
            { "t.framediag.14", new[]{ "；自动处置 {0}", "; auto-action: {0}" } },
            { "log.frameoffender.1", new[]{ "帧卡顿 处置 {0} pid {1} 压制档由 {2} 提到 {3} 下一窗验证是否有效", "Stutter: action on {0} pid {1} suppression raised from {2} to {3}; effectiveness verified next window" } },
            { "log.frameoffender.2", new[]{ "帧卡顿 处置有效 {0} 抢占解释率由 {1}% 降到 {2}% 保留提档", "Stutter: action worked on {0} preemption explained dropped from {1}% to {2}%; keeping the raise" } },
