            { "log.frameoffender.4", new[]{ "帧卡顿 数据不完整 自动处置停手 已撤销对 {0} 的提名 原因 {1}", "Stutter: data incomplete, automatic action halted; nomination of {0} withdrawn ({1})" } },
            { "gm.framediag", new[]{ "帧卡顿溯源", "Stutter attribution" } },
            { "gm.framediag.sub", new[]{ "对局中记录每一帧的边界和驱动中断的精确时长 结束时告诉你这局卡了几次 以及这些卡顿是不是中断造成的。只读取不修改任何系统状态 不碰游戏进程。需要管理员权限 观察层自身开销超预算会自动停止。", "Records every frame boundary and the exact duration of driver interrupts during a match, then tells you how many stutters there were and whether interrupts caused them. Read-only: it changes no system state and never touches the game process. Requires administrator; it stops itself if its own overhead exceeds budget." } },
            { "gm.framediag.needadmin", new[]{ "需要管理员权限 内核 ETW 会话开不了 请以管理员重启 Pavise。", "Requires administrator: the kernel ETW session cannot start. Restart Pavise as administrator." } },
