            { "t.versionmigrations.21", new[]{ "全屏游戏时桌面本就不合成 关透明与动画对帧率无可测收益 却改动了用户的系统设置", "During fullscreen games the desktop isn't composited anyway; disabling transparency and animations has no measurable frame rate gain, yet it changed the user's system settings" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.22", new[]{ "后台硬限帧", "Background hard frame cap" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.23", new[]{ "写的是 NVIDIA 基础 Profile 的全局项 限的是失去焦点的程序 玩家切出游戏时游戏自己就被限到 20 帧 双屏和挂机玩法受影响最大", "It wrote a global entry in the NVIDIA base profile, capping whatever program loses focus; the moment the player tabbed out, the game itself got capped to 20 fps. Dual-monitor and AFK play were hit hardest" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.24", new[]{ "Pavise 托管电源计划", "Pavise managed power plan" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.25", new[]{ "自建一份计划再逐项写入 等于替用户改系统设置 且和显卡驱动 厂商工具的电源策略互相打架 改成只切换不改写", "Creating its own plan and writing every setting amounted to changing system settings on the user's behalf, and it fought back and forth with GPU driver and vendor tool power policies. Changed to switching only, no rewriting" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.26", new[]{ "对局稳定后回收后台工作集", "Reclaim background working sets after the match stabilizes" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.27", new[]{ "SetProcessWorkingSetSize 不释放内存 只把页赶去待机列表 脏页还要先写盘 这笔 IO 正好落在对局中 而被压制的后台本来就是内存管理器有压力时首批自然裁剪的对象 进程没挂起 裁完立刻缺页读回 几秒后白做", "SetProcessWorkingSetSize doesn't free memory, it only pushes pages to the standby list, and dirty pages must be written to disk first — IO that lands right in the middle of the match. The suppressed background is already the first thing the memory manager naturally trims under pressure; the processes aren't suspended, so pages fault right back in after trimming. Wasted work within seconds" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.28", new[]{ "待机列表超阈值时清空", "Purge the standby list when it exceeds a threshold" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.29", new[]{ "触发条件成立时清空只换回 382MB 可用内存 代价是 1380 毫秒全系统阻塞加整个文件缓存丢弃 且 5 秒一次检查没有冷却 低配机上会形成清空到读盘到再堆积的反复触发 比它想解决的微卡更糟", "When the trigger condition held, purging recovered only 382MB of available memory, at the cost of 1380 ms of system-wide blocking plus discarding the entire file cache. With a check every 5 seconds and no cooldown, low-end machines fall into a purge, disk read, build-up-again loop that triggers repeatedly — worse than the micro-stutter it tried to fix" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.30", new[]{ "游戏时免打扰", "Do not disturb while gaming" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.31", new[]{ "只改 ToastEnabled 一个开关 微信 QQ 的弹窗是自绘窗口拦不住 全屏独占时系统横幅本就不抢焦点 实测没有收益", "It only flipped the single ToastEnabled switch; WeChat and QQ popups are self-drawn windows it can't block, and in exclusive fullscreen system banners don't steal focus anyway. No measured gain" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.32", new[]{ "刷新率是持久设置 大多数机器上每局空转 中途被系统打回也无法察觉 改由体检页只读提示", "Refresh rate is a persistent setting; on most machines this spun idle every match, and when the system reverted it mid-match it couldn't even tell. Replaced by a read-only hint on the checkup page" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.33", new[]{ "引流的诊断/更新/打印类服务本就几乎不吃 CPU 挪核收益≈0 而真正的游戏核隔离后台压制系统已覆盖", "The diagnostic/update/print services it rerouted barely use CPU, so moving them off cores gains ≈0, while real game-core isolation is already covered by background suppression" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.34", new[]{ "电源滑块最佳性能", "Power slider Best Performance" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.35", new[]{ "散热受限的笔记本上把滑块拉满会更快撞温度墙 持续性能反而下降 台式机上又与高性能电源计划重复", "On thermally limited laptops, maxing the slider hits the thermal wall sooner and sustained performance actually drops; on desktops it duplicates the high-performance power plan" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.36", new[]{ "暂停搜索索引与预读服务", "Pause search indexing and prefetch services" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.37", new[]{ "固态硬盘上测不出差异 机械盘受众极少 停止与恢复服务本身要数秒 收益覆盖不了成本", "No measurable difference on SSDs and the HDD audience is tiny; stopping and restarting the services itself takes seconds, so the gain doesn't cover the cost" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.38", new[]{ "对局中拉 PowerShell 刷 NetQos 组策略不稳定 顿挫风险大 概念虽正经但实现不可靠", "Invoking PowerShell mid-match to refresh NetQos group policy is unstable with high stutter risk; the concept is sound but the implementation unreliable" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.39", new[]{ "NVIDIA 驱动级帧率上限", "NVIDIA driver-level frame rate cap" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.40", new[]{ "AMD 驱动级帧率上限", "AMD driver-level frame rate cap" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.41", new[]{ "限帧交给游戏内设置或显卡控制面板更直接 驱动层再限一次容易与游戏自身限帧和 VRR 打架 已下架并还原驱动原值", "Frame capping is more direct in the game's own settings or the GPU control panel; capping again at the driver layer easily fights the game's own limiter and VRR. Removed, and the driver values have been restored." } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.42", new[]{ "USB 控制器中断亲和", "USB controller interrupt affinity" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.43", new[]{ "把 USB 中断绑到固定核心 在 P 核数量少的混合架构上会投到低频 E 核 造成高回报率鼠标空闲后首次点击延迟 收益不确定风险明确 已下架并还原设备中断策略到系统默认", "Pinning USB interrupts to fixed cores landed them on low-clock E-cores on hybrid CPUs with few P-cores, causing first-click delay on high-polling mice after idle. Uncertain benefit, clear risk. Removed, and device interrupt policy restored to the system default." } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.45", new[]{ "实测微软的平衡 高性能 卓越性能三套方案 该项全是 0 连专为消除电源管理延迟做的卓越性能都不碰它 全核常驻 C0 只增功耗与发热 换不来帧 而它的自检只量 CPU 峰值频率 抓不到核显被饿死那种故障 已下架并把托管方案里的该项写回允许空闲", "Measured: Microsoft leaves this at 0 in Balanced, High performance and Ultimate Performance alike — even Ultimate Performance, built specifically to remove power-management latency, does not touch it. Pinning every core at C0 only adds power draw and heat without buying frames, and its self-check only measured peak CPU frequency, which cannot detect a starved iGPU. Removed, and the setting in the managed plan is written back to allowing idle." } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.44", new[]{ "按 exe 写注册表且下次启动才生效 属持久改动却混在对局链里装作会话功能 现代 Windows 本就默认给游戏挑独显 已下架并还原写过的偏好", "It wrote per-exe registry entries effective only on the next launch — a persistent change masquerading as a session feature inside the match pipeline, and modern Windows already defaults games to the discrete GPU. Removed, and previously written preferences restored." } },
