            { "t.systemauditverdicts.5", new[]{ "Hz 这一项比本页任何调度优化的收益都直接 帧数上限是翻倍级别的差距 而且没有任何代价 做法 系统设置 显示 高级显示 里把刷新率改到 ", "Hz. This item pays off more directly than any scheduling optimization on this page — the frame-rate ceiling gap is doubling-level, at zero cost. How: in Windows Settings > Display > Advanced display, change the refresh rate to " } },
