            { "t.systemauditverdicts.7", new[]{ "筛选键", "Filter Keys" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.8", new[]{ "筛选键在输入路径上主动插入了 ", "Filter Keys is actively inserting " } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.9", new[]{ " 毫秒的接受延迟 键鼠这条链上外设段总共才 1 到 5 毫秒 这一项一个人就顶掉了好几倍 多数人是玩游戏时长按 Shift 被弹窗误开的 做法 系统环境页拨开 辅助功能拦截 开关 不需要管理员也不用重启", " ms of acceptance delay into the input path. The peripheral segment of the whole keyboard/mouse chain totals only 1 to 5 ms; this one item alone is several times that. Most people enabled it by accident via the popup while holding Shift in a game. How: flip the Accessibility Blocking switch on the System Environment page. No admin rights or reboot needed." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.10", new[]{ "辅助功能热键", "Accessibility hotkeys" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.11", new[]{ "建议关闭", "Recommend disabling" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.12", new[]{ "当前不吞击键 但开关或热键还留着 连按五次 Shift 或长按右 Shift 八秒会在全屏游戏里弹窗 打断一次团战的代价比任何毫秒级优化都大 做法 系统环境页拨开 辅助功能拦截 开关", "Not swallowing keystrokes right now, but the switch or hotkey is still armed. Pressing Shift five times or holding right Shift for eight seconds pops a dialog over your fullscreen game — one interrupted teamfight costs more than any millisecond-level optimization gains. How: flip the Accessibility Blocking switch on the System Environment page." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.13", new[]{ "蓝牙键鼠", "Bluetooth keyboard/mouse" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.14", new[]{ "建议换连接方式", "Recommend switching connection type" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.15", new[]{ "台架实测同一只鼠标蓝牙约 10.4 毫秒 2.4G 接收器约 3.6 毫秒 而 2.4G 与有线基本无差 无线比有线慢是过时说法 但蓝牙确实慢 而且这七毫秒比本页所有软件优化加起来都多 做法 插 2.4G 接收器或换有线 没有软件解法", "Bench-verified with the same mouse: about 10.4 ms over Bluetooth versus about 3.6 ms on a 2.4G receiver, and 2.4G is essentially identical to wired. 'Wireless is slower than wired' is outdated, but Bluetooth really is slow, and those 7 ms outweigh every software optimization on this page combined. How: plug in a 2.4G receiver or go wired. There is no software fix." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.16", new[]{ "治的是空闲一段时间后第一下操作的顿挫 不是稳态延迟 台式机没有代价直接关 笔记本要权衡续航 做法 系统环境页拨开 键鼠设备省电 开关", "This fixes the hitch on the first input after a stretch of idle, not steady-state latency. On desktops there is no cost, just turn it off; on laptops weigh battery life. How: flip the Keyboard/Mouse Power Saving switch on the System Environment page." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.17", new[]{ "键鼠队列长度", "Keyboard/mouse queue length" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.18", new[]{ "建议改回默认", "Recommend reverting to default" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.19", new[]{ "有工具把它改过 这个值决定能缓存多少条输入 不决定输入被处理的快慢 所以调它不降延迟 调低了还会在高回报率鼠标上丢输入 点右侧一键修复改回默认 100 重启生效 可还原", "A tool has changed it. This value controls how many input events can be buffered, not how fast input is processed, so tuning it does not reduce latency — and lowering it can drop inputs on high polling-rate mice. Click one-click fix on the right to restore the default 100; takes effect after reboot; restorable." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.20", new[]{ "输入延迟的大头在哪", "Where input latency actually comes from" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.21", new[]{ "看清楚再动手", "Understand this before tweaking" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.22", new[]{ "端到端延迟三段 外设 1 到 5 毫秒 渲染管线在 GPU 打满时 20 到 60 毫秒 显示器 3 到 20 毫秒 所以键鼠注册表偏方是在错的量级上花力气 真正的大头是渲染队列堆积 做法 游戏支持 NVIDIA Reflex 或 AMD Anti-Lag 就在游戏里开 没有就把帧率上限压到 GPU 占用 90 到 95 百分比 别顶着刷新率上限跑 那会隐式触发垂直同步 反而多加半帧到一帧 显卡页的帧率上限和低延迟就是干这个的", "End-to-end latency has three segments: peripherals 1 to 5 ms, the render pipeline 20 to 60 ms when the GPU is maxed out, and the display 3 to 20 ms. So keyboard/mouse registry hacks spend effort at the wrong order of magnitude — the real bulk is render queue buildup. How: if the game supports NVIDIA Reflex or AMD Anti-Lag, enable it in-game; otherwise cap the frame rate so GPU usage sits at 90 to 95 percent. Do not run pinned at the refresh-rate ceiling — that implicitly triggers vsync and adds an extra half to one frame instead. The frame rate cap and low latency options on the GPU page exist exactly for this." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.23", new[]{ "已开启 不用处理", "Already on. No action needed." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.24", new[]{ "建议开启", "Recommend enabling" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.25", new[]{ "合成台架六轮配对实测 1% 最差帧改善中位 90.7% 而且免疫随时间累积的恶化", "Six rounds of paired testing on the synthetic bench: median 90.7% improvement in 1% worst frames, and immune to the degradation that accumulates over time." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.26", new[]{ "Windows 游戏模式", "Windows Game Mode" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.27", new[]{ "系统原生的游戏时段后台抑制 没有兼容风险", "The system's native background suppression during gaming. No compatibility risk." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.28", new[]{ "NVIDIA 深度调优", "NVIDIA deep tuning" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.29", new[]{ "可以尝试", "Worth trying" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.30", new[]{ "本机不适用", "Not applicable on this machine" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.31", new[]{ "显卡页按游戏开启 写入连续失败会自动关闭对应开关", "Enable per game on the GPU page. Consecutive write failures automatically turn the corresponding switch off." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.32", new[]{ "核显没有对应的调优接口 这一项跳过 收益从压制 绑核和电源那边拿", "Integrated graphics has no matching tuning interface; skip this item. Get the gains from suppression, core binding, and power instead." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.33", new[]{ "没有 NVIDIA 驱动接口", "No NVIDIA driver interface" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.34", new[]{ "中断负载", "Interrupt load" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.35", new[]{ "建议处理", "Recommend fixing" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.36", new[]{ "不用处理", "No action needed" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.37", new[]{ "有个核心 ", "One core spends " } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.38", new[]{ " 的时间在处理硬件中断 头号来源是 ", " of its time servicing hardware interrupts; the top source is " } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.39", new[]{ " 做法 它属于显卡就开 GPU 中断亲和 硬盘和网卡类的中断路由属于驱动层 本软件的避让开关够不到 只能等驱动更新", " — How: if it belongs to the GPU, enable GPU interrupt affinity. Interrupt routing for disk and network devices lives in the driver layer — this app's avoidance switches cannot reach it; only a driver update can." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.40", new[]{ " 的时间在处理硬件中断 做法 系统环境页开两个避让开关 重启后再体检对比 数值降了就是它们 降不下来是硬盘 网卡或主板设备在响 那层属于驱动和硬件 本软件不碰", " of its time servicing hardware interrupts. How: enable the two avoidance switches on the System Environment page, reboot, then run the checkup again to compare. If the number drops, they were the cause; if it does not, disk, network, or motherboard devices are firing — that layer belongs to drivers and hardware, and this app does not touch it." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.41", new[]{ "当前量级 ", "Current magnitude " } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.42", new[]{ " 很小 感觉不出来 不用管", " is tiny, imperceptible. Ignore it." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.43", new[]{ "Game DVR 后台录制", "Game DVR background recording" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.44", new[]{ "后台录制一直开着就一直有开销 多数人根本不用 Xbox Game Bar 录制", "Background recording costs overhead the whole time it is on, and most people never use Xbox Game Bar recording at all." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.45", new[]{ "内存余量", "Memory headroom" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.46", new[]{ "只剩 ", "Only " } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.47", new[]{ " GB 可用 内存不够时系统会拿硬盘顶内存 那是毫秒级的等待 比任何调度问题都更容易造成明显卡顿 做法 退掉吃内存的后台程序 长期紧张就加内存条 这个没有软件解法", " GB free. When memory runs short, the system substitutes disk for RAM — millisecond-scale waits that cause visible stutter more readily than any scheduling issue. How: quit memory-hungry background programs; if it stays tight long-term, add RAM. There is no software fix." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.48", new[]{ "可以尝试关闭", "Worth trying to disable" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.49", new[]{ "有代价 影响内存完整性 WSL2 Docker 和沙盒 用这些功能就别关 做法 系统环境页找 VBS 卡片 拨开开关 重启生效", "There is a cost: it affects Memory Integrity, WSL2, Docker, and Sandbox. If you use those features, do not turn it off. How: find the VBS card on the System Environment page and flip the switch; takes effect after reboot." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.50", new[]{ "平台时钟", "Platform timer" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.51", new[]{ "建议校正", "Recommend correcting" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.52", new[]{ "强制 HPET 是十年前的教程遗产 TSC 计时比它快几个数量级 点右侧一键修复即可清掉 重启生效 可还原", "Forcing HPET is a relic of decade-old tutorials; TSC timing is orders of magnitude faster. Click one-click fix on the right to clear it; takes effect after reboot; restorable." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.53", new[]{ "页面文件", "Page file" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.54", new[]{ "建议恢复", "Recommend restoring" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.55", new[]{ "关页面文件不提帧 只把内存吃紧时的变慢换成直接崩溃 部分游戏和反作弊还要求它存在", "Disabling the page file does not raise FPS; it just turns slowdown under memory pressure into outright crashes. Some games and anti-cheat systems also require it to exist." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.56", new[]{ "可用托管方案解除", "Use the managed plan to lift it" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.57", new[]{ "当前电源方案在低负载时会让部分 CPU 核心进入停泊 从停泊态唤醒有额外延迟 表现为偶发顿挫和 1% 最差帧变差 在策略页开启 Pavise 托管电源方案即可让对局全程保持全部核心唤醒 或到 Windows 电源选项里把处理器最小状态调高手动解除", "The current power plan parks some CPU cores at low load. Waking from the parked state adds latency, showing up as occasional hitches and worse 1% lows. Enable the Pavise managed power plan on the Strategy page to keep all cores awake throughout matches, or raise the processor minimum state in Windows power options to lift it manually." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.58", new[]{ "与核心分区叠加", "Compounds with core partitioning" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.59", new[]{ "　你同时开启了核心分区 游戏被固定在少数核心上 这几个核一旦停泊 游戏没有别的核可去 只能原地等待唤醒 不分区时调度器还能临时换一个醒着的核 所以两项同时开启比任何一项单独开启都更容易出现帧生成时间毛刺 Pavise 不会改动你自己选定的电源方案 是否解除停泊由你决定", " You also have core partitioning on: the game is pinned to a small set of cores, and once those park it has nowhere else to run and must wait for them to wake. Without partitioning the scheduler could borrow another awake core, so the two together are more prone to frame-time spikes than either alone. Pavise does not modify a power plan you selected yourself; lifting parking is your call." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.1", new[]{ "干净", "Clean" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.2", new[]{ "异常", "Abnormal" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.3", new[]{ "本机只有核显 显卡页的驱动深度调优不适用 但后台压制 绑核 电源计划照常有效 帧数收益主要从那边来", "This machine has only integrated graphics; the GPU page's deep driver tuning does not apply, but background suppression, core binding, and power plans work as usual — that is where the FPS gains mainly come from." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.4", new[]{ "带独显 显卡页的驱动项能不能用 看下面两行接口检测", "Discrete GPU present. Whether the GPU page's driver items work depends on the two interface checks below." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.5", new[]{ "NVIDIA 驱动接口", "NVIDIA driver interface" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.6", new[]{ "可用", "Available" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.7", new[]{ "不可用", "Unavailable" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.8", new[]{ "电源 帧率上限 预渲染这些驱动项在本机可用 写入失败会自动熔断对应开关", "Driver items like power, frame rate cap, and pre-rendered frames are available on this machine. A write failure automatically trips the corresponding switch off." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.9", new[]{ "有 N 卡但驱动接口调不起来 多半是驱动太老或者装的精简版 显卡页 NVIDIA 区整体停用", "An NVIDIA card is present but the driver interface will not come up, usually because the driver is too old or a stripped-down build. The NVIDIA section of the GPU page is disabled entirely." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.10", new[]{ "本机没有 NVIDIA 显卡 显卡页 NVIDIA 区整体停用", "No NVIDIA GPU on this machine. The NVIDIA section of the GPU page is disabled entirely." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.11", new[]{ "AMD 显卡", "AMD GPU" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.12", new[]{ "已识别", "Detected" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.13", new[]{ "未检测到", "Not detected" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.14", new[]{ "驱动专项调优只覆盖 NVIDIA A 卡的收益来自压制 绑核 电源这些通用优化", "Dedicated driver tuning covers NVIDIA only. AMD cards get their gains from the universal optimizations — suppression, core binding, and power." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.15", new[]{ "本机没有 AMD 显卡", "No AMD GPU on this machine" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.16", new[]{ "CPU Sets 分区", "CPU Sets partitioning" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.17", new[]{ "可以把后台赶去单独的核心 好核心留给游戏", "Can push background processes onto dedicated cores, leaving the good cores for the game" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.18", new[]{ "核心不够分 压制只降优先级 实测这一步已经占了绝大部分收益", "Not enough cores to partition; suppression only lowers priorities. Measured, that step already accounts for the vast majority of the gains." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.19", new[]{ "效率模式 EcoQoS", "Efficiency mode (EcoQoS)" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.20", new[]{ "不支持", "Not supported" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.21", new[]{ "支持", "Supported" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.22", new[]{ "接口可用", "Interface available" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.23", new[]{ "本机查不到这个状态 温和档会自动跳过这一手段", "This state cannot be queried on this machine; the gentle tier automatically skips this technique." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.24", new[]{ "温和档能让系统把后台降频 挪去省电核心", "The gentle tier lets the system down-clock background processes and move them to efficiency cores." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.25", new[]{ "Windows 10 上也能压 只是没有 Windows 11 压得彻底 效果还是有", "Suppression works on Windows 10 too, just not as thoroughly as on Windows 11; the effect is still there." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.26", new[]{ "操作系统", "Operating system" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.27", new[]{ "系统版本决定哪些手段可用 同一个开关在不同版本上干的事不一样", "The Windows version determines which techniques are available; the same switch does different things on different versions." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.28", new[]{ "混合架构 P 核加 E 核 默认全核 可手动切性能核", "Hybrid architecture (P-cores plus E-cores). Defaults to all cores; can manually switch to the performance cores." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.29", new[]{ "非对称缓存 X3D 默认全核 可手动切大缓存 CCD", "Asymmetric cache (X3D). Defaults to all cores; can manually switch to the large-cache CCD." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.30", new[]{ "对称多 CCD 默认全核 可手动切一个完整 CCD", "Symmetric multi-CCD. Defaults to all cores; can manually switch to one full CCD." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.31", new[]{ "同构 默认全核 可手动切游戏核心分区", "Homogeneous. Defaults to all cores; can manually switch to a game core partition." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.32", new[]{ "同构", "Homogeneous" } },
