            { "t.systemaudit.55", new[]{ " 可用 ", " available " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.56", new[]{ "读不到显示模式 远程桌面和部分虚拟显示器上会这样 这一项本次不做判断", "Display mode could not be read; this happens over Remote Desktop and on some virtual displays. This item is skipped this time." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.57", new[]{ "当前分辨率下没有更高的刷新率可选", "No higher refresh rate is available at the current resolution" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.58", new[]{ "系统跑在 ", "The system is running at " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.59", new[]{ "Hz 这块屏在同分辨率下支持 ", "Hz, but at the same resolution this display supports " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.60", new[]{ "Hz 这是实打实的帧数损失 做法 系统设置 显示 高级显示 里把刷新率改到 ", "Hz. That is a very real FPS loss. How: in Windows Settings > Display > Advanced display, change the refresh rate to " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.61", new[]{ "Hz 这是持久设置 改一次就一直生效", "Hz. This is a persistent setting; change it once and it stays." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.62", new[]{ "NVIDIA 降频状态", "NVIDIA throttling status" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.63", new[]{ "显卡正被这些原因压着 游戏中要是长期这样 瓶颈在散热或供电 不在调度", "The GPU is currently being held back by these reasons. If this persists during games, the bottleneck is cooling or power delivery, not scheduling." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.64", new[]{ "当前没有降频 游戏中要是被压制 每局结束会写进运行日志", "No throttling right now. If it gets throttled during a match, it is written to the run log at the end of each match." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.65", new[]{ "节能模式", "Energy saver mode" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.66", new[]{ "开着", "On" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.67", new[]{ "关着", "Off" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.68", new[]{ "系统正在省电 会限亮度拦后台 电源模式也被锁住改不了 Pavise 的电源优化会失效 打游戏前去设置里关掉", "Windows is in power-saving mode: it limits brightness, blocks background activity, and locks the power mode so it cannot be changed. Pavise's power optimizations will not take effect. Turn it off in Settings before gaming." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.69", new[]{ "没有拦着电源优化", "Not blocking power optimizations" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.70", new[]{ "生效中", "Active" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.71", new[]{ "长时间不碰键鼠也不会把前台程序降级", "Leaving the keyboard and mouse untouched for a long time will not demote the foreground app" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.72", new[]{ "系统默认会在长时间没有键鼠输入后给前台程序降级 手柄游戏 过场动画 挂机正好中招 策略页可以关掉它", "By default, Windows demotes the foreground app after a long stretch without keyboard or mouse input — controller gaming, cutscenes, and idling all get hit. You can turn this off on the Strategy page." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.73", new[]{ "ReBAR 显存直通", "ReBAR VRAM direct access" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.74", new[]{ " 窗口 ", " window " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.75", new[]{ "显卡页的 ReBAR 强开可用", "ReBAR force-enable on the GPU page is available" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.76", new[]{ "没开启时 ReBAR 强开无效 要在 BIOS 里打开", "With it off, ReBAR force-enable has no effect; it must be enabled in the BIOS" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.77", new[]{ "A 卡叫 SAM 驱动侧已自动受益 不需要 Pavise 干预", "On AMD cards it is called SAM; the driver side already benefits automatically, no Pavise intervention needed" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.78", new[]{ "A 卡叫 SAM 要在 BIOS 里打开 Above 4G 和 ReBAR", "On AMD cards it is called SAM; enable Above 4G and ReBAR in the BIOS" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.79", new[]{ "内存", "Memory" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.80", new[]{ " GB 已用 ", " GB, used " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.81", new[]{ "可用内存偏少 大型游戏可能被挤去拿硬盘顶内存而卡顿 建议关掉部分后台或者开启待机内存清理", "Available memory is low; large games may get pushed into using disk as memory and stutter. Close some background apps or enable the standby memory purge." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.82", new[]{ "内存余量充足", "Plenty of memory headroom" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.83", new[]{ "已被关闭", "Disabled" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.84", new[]{ "老优化教程爱关页面文件 内存吃紧时游戏会直接崩溃或闪退 而不是变慢 建议在系统高级设置里交回系统管理", "Old optimization guides love disabling the page file. Under memory pressure, games then crash or exit outright instead of slowing down. Hand it back to system management in advanced system settings." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.85", new[]{ "由系统管理或大小正常 不用处理", "System-managed or normally sized. No action needed." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.86", new[]{ "网络链路", "Network link" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.87", new[]{ "有线", "Wired" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.88", new[]{ "无线 Wi-Fi", "Wireless (Wi-Fi)" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.89", new[]{ "有线加无线同时在线", "Wired and wireless both online" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.90", new[]{ "无线的延迟和突刺天生比有线高 策略页的无线扫描抑制能砍掉后台扫信道那类周期突刺 有条件还是上网线", "Wireless inherently has higher latency and spikes than wired. The wireless scan suppression on the Strategy page cuts the periodic spikes from background channel scans, but use an Ethernet cable if you can." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.91", new[]{ "有线链路 延迟稳定性最好", "Wired link, best latency stability" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.92", new[]{ "两条链路都通 游戏流量走哪条取决于系统路由 想确保走有线可以临时关掉 Wi-Fi", "Both links are up; which one game traffic takes depends on system routing. To make sure it goes wired, temporarily turn off Wi-Fi." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.93", new[]{ "供电方式", "Power source" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.94", new[]{ "外接电源", "AC power" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.95", new[]{ "电池供电", "On battery" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.96", new[]{ "笔记本已接电源 性能不受电池策略限制", "Laptop is plugged in; performance is not limited by battery policy" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.97", new[]{ "电池供电时厂商固件通常会限制 CPU 和 GPU 功耗 这时候任何调度优化都补不回损失的性能 插上电源再对比", "On battery, vendor firmware usually caps CPU and GPU power, and no scheduling optimization can recover that lost performance. Plug in and compare." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.98", new[]{ "后台占用前三", "Top 3 background CPU consumers" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.99", new[]{ "最近 ", "In the last " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.100", new[]{ " 秒内最吃 CPU 的程序 压制最能从它们身上抢回资源 有想保护的就加白名单", " seconds, the programs eating the most CPU. Suppression reclaims the most resources from them; whitelist any you want to protect." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.101", new[]{ " 加 ", " plus " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.102", new[]{ "鼠标 ", "Mouse " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.103", new[]{ "键盘 ", "Keyboard " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.104", new[]{ "蓝牙键鼠是整条延迟链上外设段唯一的两位数毫秒损失 台架实测同一只鼠标蓝牙约 10.4 毫秒 换 2.4G 接收器约 3.6 毫秒 而 2.4G 和有线基本无差 做法 插上随附的 2.4G 接收器 或者换有线 这个没有软件解法", "Bluetooth keyboards and mice are the only double-digit-millisecond loss in the peripheral segment of the latency chain. Bench-verified with the same mouse: about 10.4 ms over Bluetooth, about 3.6 ms on a 2.4G receiver, and 2.4G is essentially identical to wired. How: plug in the bundled 2.4G receiver or go wired. There is no software fix." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.105", new[]{ "同时枚举到蓝牙和更快的连接 蓝牙那只可能只是配过对没在用 如果实际在用的是蓝牙 换 2.4G 接收器或有线能省约 7 毫秒", "Both Bluetooth and a faster connection were enumerated; the Bluetooth one may just be paired but unused. If Bluetooth is what you actually use, switching to a 2.4G receiver or wired saves about 7 ms." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.106", new[]{ "USB 直连和 2.4G 接收器的外设延迟都在 1 到 5 毫秒 已经是这一段的下限 再往下抠要动硬件", "Direct USB and 2.4G receivers both sit at 1 to 5 ms of peripheral latency — already the floor for this segment. Going lower means changing hardware." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.107", new[]{ "筛选键正开着", "Filter Keys is on" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.108", new[]{ "热键激活", "Hotkey armed" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.109", new[]{ "筛选键按微软自己的定义就是让键盘忽略短促或重复的击键 现在每次击键要等 ", "By Microsoft's own definition, Filter Keys makes the keyboard ignore brief or repeated keystrokes. Right now every keystroke waits " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.110", new[]{ " 毫秒才被接受 这是本页所有键鼠项里唯一能救回两位数毫秒的一条 做法 系统环境页拨开 辅助功能拦截 开关", " ms before being accepted. This is the only keyboard/mouse item on this page that can win back double-digit milliseconds. How: flip the Accessibility Blocking switch on the System Environment page." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.111", new[]{ "当前没有造成输入延迟 但开关或热键还留着 连按五次 Shift 或长按右 Shift 八秒会弹窗打断全屏游戏 做法 系统环境页拨开 辅助功能拦截 开关 一次清掉 不需要管理员也不用重启", "Not adding input latency right now, but the switch or hotkey is still armed. Pressing Shift five times or holding right Shift for eight seconds pops a dialog that interrupts fullscreen games. How: flip the Accessibility Blocking switch on the System Environment page to clear it in one go. No admin rights or reboot needed." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.112", new[]{ "筛选键 粘滞键 切换键都没开 热键也没激活 不会拦你的击键", "Filter Keys, Sticky Keys, and Toggle Keys are all off, and no hotkeys are armed. Nothing will intercept your keystrokes." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.113", new[]{ "允许挂起", "Suspend allowed" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.114", new[]{ "已禁止挂起", "Suspend disallowed" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.115", new[]{ "系统被允许在空闲后挂起键鼠所在的 USB 设备 微软自己的选择性暂停文档承认 退出挂起的延迟会表现为屏幕上的顿挫 治的是空闲后第一下操作的抖动 不是稳态延迟 做法 系统环境页拨开 键鼠设备省电 开关", "Windows is allowed to suspend the USB devices hosting your keyboard and mouse after idle. Microsoft's own selective-suspend documentation admits that resume-from-suspend latency shows up as on-screen hitches. This fixes the jitter on the first input after idle, not steady-state latency. How: flip the Keyboard/Mouse Power Saving switch on the System Environment page." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.116", new[]{ "键鼠 USB 设备都不允许省电挂起 没有唤醒顿挫", "Keyboard/mouse USB devices are not allowed to power-save suspend. No wake-up hitches." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.119", new[]{ "键鼠队列长度被改过", "Keyboard/mouse queue length has been modified" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.120", new[]{ "ThreadDpcEnable 被写成 ", "ThreadDpcEnable was set to " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.121", new[]{ "第三方键鼠改动", "Third-party keyboard/mouse modifications" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.122", new[]{ "队列长度控制的是能缓存多少条输入 不是这些数据被处理的快慢 所以调它不降延迟 调低了反而在高回报率鼠标上丢输入 做法 系统环境页拨开 键鼠队列校正 开关改回默认 ", "Queue length controls how many input events can be buffered, not how fast that data is processed, so tuning it does not reduce latency — lowering it actually drops inputs on high polling-rate mice. How: flip the Keyboard/Mouse Queue Correction switch on the System Environment page to restore the default " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.123", new[]{ " 重启生效  ", " — takes effect after reboot  " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.124", new[]{ "ThreadDpcEnable 找不到任何可信的对照测量支撑 属于优化脚本的祖传条目 本软件不代改也不建议留着 要清就手动删 HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Session Manager\\kernel 下的 ThreadDpcEnable", "ThreadDpcEnable has no credible controlled measurements behind it — an heirloom entry from optimization scripts. This app will not change it for you but does not recommend keeping it. To clear it, manually delete ThreadDpcEnable under HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Session Manager\\kernel." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.125", new[]{ "HAGS 硬件加速 GPU 调度", "HAGS hardware-accelerated GPU scheduling" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.126", new[]{ "改动需要重启生效 收益因机而异 没有普适结论", "Changing it requires a reboot; gains vary by machine, with no universal verdict." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.127", new[]{ "VBS 基于虚拟化的安全", "VBS virtualization-based security" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.128", new[]{ "关闭可能带来性能提升 代价是内存完整性 WSL2 Docker 和 Windows 沙盒都会受影响", "Turning it off may improve performance, at the cost of Memory Integrity; WSL2, Docker, and Windows Sandbox are all affected." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.129", new[]{ "已经是关闭状态 不用处理", "Already off. No action needed." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.130", new[]{ "系统会在游戏时抑制部分后台活动 保持就行", "Windows suppresses some background activity while gaming. Keep it as is." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.131", new[]{ "现在是关着的 常见于旧优化教程 建议在系统环境页开启守护", "Currently off — common after old optimization guides. Recommend enabling the guardian on the System Environment page." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.132", new[]{ "MPO 多平面叠加", "MPO multi-plane overlay" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.133", new[]{ "已被禁用", "Disabled" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.134", new[]{ "系统默认", "System default" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.135", new[]{ "被某个工具或手动教程关掉了 画面会全部改走合成 录屏直播远程这类抓屏程序也可能受影响 想改回默认删掉注册表 HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Dwm 下的 OverlayTestMode 重启即可", "Disabled by some tool or manual guide. Everything now goes through composition, and screen-capture apps for recording, streaming, or remote access may also be affected. To restore the default, delete OverlayTestMode under HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Dwm and reboot." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.136", new[]{ "保持系统默认 这一项 Pavise 不再提供开关", "At system default. Pavise no longer offers a switch for this item." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.137", new[]{ "Xbox Game Bar 一直在后台悄悄录着画面 占帧数 建议在优化策略页关掉", "Xbox Game Bar has been quietly recording the screen in the background, costing frames. Turn it off on the Strategy page." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.138", new[]{ "已关闭 不用处理", "Off. No action needed." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.139", new[]{ "当前电源计划", "Current power plan" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.140", new[]{ "开了电源计划开关后 对局中会自动切到高性能或卓越性能 结束后还原 不用手动改", "With the power plan switch on, Pavise automatically switches to High Performance or Ultimate Performance during a match and restores it afterward. No manual change needed." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.141", new[]{ "陈旧覆盖 ", "Stale override " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.142", new[]{ "启动配置里有老教程写的时钟覆盖 强制 HPET 在现代平台上是纯减益 点右侧一键修复即可清掉 重启生效 可还原", "The boot configuration contains a clock override written by old guides. Forcing HPET is a pure loss on modern platforms. Click one-click fix on the right to clear it; takes effect after reboot; restorable." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.143", new[]{ "启动配置干净 系统用最快的 TSC 计时", "Boot configuration is clean; the system uses the fastest TSC timing." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.144", new[]{ "前台时间片", "Foreground time slice" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.145", new[]{ "被改动", "Modified" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.146", new[]{ "Win32PrioritySeparation 被工具或教程改过 前台程序的时间片分配偏离系统默认 点右侧一键修复改回默认 2 可还原", "Win32PrioritySeparation was changed by a tool or guide; foreground time-slice allocation deviates from the system default. Click one-click fix on the right to restore the default 2; restorable." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.147", new[]{ "前台时间片分配保持系统默认 不用处理", "Foreground time-slice allocation is at the system default. No action needed." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.148", new[]{ "网络限流值", "Network throttling index" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.149", new[]{ "NetworkThrottlingIndex 被改成非默认值 网上教程说能优化 实测只会干扰多媒体调度 点右侧一键修复改回默认 10 可还原", "NetworkThrottlingIndex was changed to a non-default value. Online guides claim it optimizes; measured, it only disrupts multimedia scheduling. Click one-click fix on the right to restore the default 10; restorable." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.150", new[]{ "网络限流值保持系统默认 不用处理", "Network throttling index is at the system default. No action needed." } },
